100: 3.2 Measurements In the following, we describe the measurements we took during our one-week-long study.
101: *3.2.1 Initial Questions.* In an initial questionnaire, we queried demographic data (age, gender) and data related to social media usage. In single-item questions, participants were asked to state how much they agreed with certain statements, from 1 (strongly agree) to 5 (strongly disagree). These statements were: "I often spend more time on social media than I intended to.", "I often feel like scrolling through posts without reaching the end." and "I often feel stuck on unnecessary posts for a long time."

