212: 4.4 Differences in Applications: Valence and Time From the SAM questionnaire, we only extracted the values for valence as our main objective, which is an indicator for positive or negative feelings [6]. Hence, we fitted two further linear mixed models to predict Time and Valence with Application (Ref: TikTok) (see Table 1). Valence was measured through Questionnaires, while Time is an objective measurement on Overall Sessions. We found significant negative effects of Facebook, Instagram, Reddit, and Twitter in Time. This means that TikTok sessions are significantly longer than those of the other applications. We also report Proc. ACM Hum.-Comput. Interact., Vol. 7, No. MHCI, Article 228. Publication date: September 2023.
